Output frames-ledger-140x45-extensions/
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1620
Set Height 1070
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "cd $LEDGER && stty cols 140 rows 45 && clear && bun run main.ts"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "3j"
Sleep 400ms
Show
Sleep 500ms
Hide
Type "q"
